@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Read the API contract for this release
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/openapi.json

### Confirm the catalog loaded
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Choose an incident
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scenarios

### Inspect the brief and evidence
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scenarios/sqs-backlog

### Compare your diagnosis with the worked response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scenarios/sqs-backlog/debrief
